1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,338
Jirani yangu aliinama karibu na sikio langu. Akanong'ona:

2
00:00:04,838 --> 00:00:11,638
Neema... namjua mganga. Atamrudisha. Au atamfanya alipe.

3
00:00:12,138 --> 00:00:16,839
Nitakuambia ukweli. Kwa sekunde moja... nilitaka kusema ndiyo.

4
00:00:20,389 --> 00:00:24,311
Naitwa Neema. Nauza samaki pale Kariakoo. Naamka saa kumi

5
00:00:24,311 --> 00:00:28,026
alfajiri, kila siku, kwa ajili ya watoto wangu wawili.

6
00:00:28,876 --> 00:00:32,977
Binti yangu Rehema, miaka kumi na minne. Anataka kuwa daktari.

7
00:00:33,827 --> 00:00:37,039
Sisi wanawake kumi na wawili tulikuwa na chama.

8
00:00:37,039 --> 00:00:41,276
Kila wiki, shilingi elfu ishirini. Na mwezi Desemba... ilikuwa

9
00:00:41,276 --> 00:00:44,283
zamu yangu. Ada yote ya Rehema ilikuwa pale.

10
00:00:45,133 --> 00:00:48,543
Mweka hazina alikuwa Shangazi Rose. Tuliimba kwaya

11
00:00:48,543 --> 00:00:51,748
pamoja. Alimbeba mwanangu siku ya ubatizo wake.

12
00:00:52,598 --> 00:00:56,925
Siku ya zamu yangu... simu yake imezimwa. Duka limefungwa. Rose

13
00:00:56,925 --> 00:01:01,114
ameondoka. Na shilingi milioni tatu za familia kumi na mbili.

14
00:01:01,964 --> 00:01:06,532
Mnaijua aibu ile? Soko zima linakutazama. Na wewe ndiye uliyemwamini.

15
00:01:07,382 --> 00:01:10,460
Ndipo jirani yule akaja na lile neno la mganga.

16
00:01:11,310 --> 00:01:15,373
Lakini usiku ule, nilifungua Biblia. Na neno moja likanishika:

17
00:01:15,873 --> 00:01:21,384
Wapenzi, msijilipizie kisasi. Kisasi ni juu yangu mimi; mimi nitalipa,

18
00:01:21,384 --> 00:01:25,162
anena Bwana. Warumi kumi na mbili, kumi na tisa.

19
00:01:26,462 --> 00:01:29,568
Rehema alinisikia nikilia. Akakaa karibu nami,

20
00:01:29,568 --> 00:01:32,472
akasema: Mama, naweza kusubiri mwaka mmoja.

21
00:01:33,322 --> 00:01:37,807
Moyo wangu ulivunjika. Nikamwambia: hapana, mwanangu. Huu si mzigo wako.

22
00:01:38,657 --> 00:01:43,277
Jumapili, Mchungaji aliwakusanya wanawake wa chama. Hatukuomba dhidi

23
00:01:43,277 --> 00:01:46,198
ya Rose. Tuliomba kwa ajili ya watoto wetu.

24
00:01:47,048 --> 00:01:51,262
Mkuu wa shule akaniruhusu kulipa ada kwa awamu tatu. Nikaongeza

25
00:01:51,262 --> 00:01:55,141
biashara ya jioni. Rehema akasomea mezani, kati ya wateja.

26
00:01:55,991 --> 00:01:59,996
Miezi saba baadaye... mlango ukagongwa. Alikuwa Rose.

27
00:02:00,946 --> 00:02:06,566
Amekonda. Mikono inatetemeka. Akanipa bahasha. Haikuwa yote... lakini ilikuwa mwanzo.

28
00:02:07,416 --> 00:02:10,399
Sijasahau. Lakini nimesamehe. Na leo, Rehema

29
00:02:10,399 --> 00:02:12,705
ni wa kwanza darasani kwa sayansi.

30
00:02:13,555 --> 00:02:18,138
Na wewe je? Umewahi kusalitiwa na mtu uliyemwamini? Niandikie kwenye

31
00:02:18,138 --> 00:02:21,710
maoni. Na mtumie dada yako video hii kwenye WhatsApp.

32
00:02:22,810 --> 00:02:28,191
Community Covenant ni programu ya bure ya Biblia na maombi, na timu inayokuombea.

33
00:02:28,691 --> 00:02:35,308
Fungua covenant dot crispus mundo dot com. Na jiunge na chaneli kwa hadithi zaidi. Mungu akubariki.

